  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Animal Companion class feature, Mount class feature, or Beastmastery sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When your animal companion or a creature you are mounted on succeeds on a combat maneuver, you may expend your martial focus as a free action even when it is not your turn to count the maneuver as though you had performed it for the purpose of any feats or talents you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
